 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1533610",
 "html": "<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1563241607914\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/a608c5809e1d4d6f828b86cae9977fee_1563241607914_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Greetings, Agents!</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This is CM Fragment of the MARVEL Future Fight team.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The final battle is coming to an end.&nbsp;<br>\nThe long awaited improvement to the uniforms for MARVEL’s <em>Avengers: Endgame</em> is finally here.<br>\nCheck out the spectacular skills and enhanced effects straight from the movie right now!</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Captain America with Mjolnir! Improvements to both uniforms of <strong>Captain America’s [Avengers: Endgame] and [Team Suit]</strong>.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Added Thor and Rescue with synergized attacks and the Nano Gauntlet in the improvements to <strong>Iron Man’s [Avengers: Endgame] and [Team Suit] uniforms.</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>Thanos </strong>blasting the battlefield with his powerful fleet in his improved <strong>[Avengers: Endgame] uniform</strong>!</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">And, an amazing surprise change for Agents!<br>\n<strong>Mysterio’s [Spider-Man: Farm From Home] uniform</strong> has&nbsp;been improved!</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ Improved 6 Uniforms</strong></span></span></span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Check out the improvements to the uniforms of the Avengers and Mysterio.</span></span></span>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1563269672826\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/87890ac6e7164bab842732fd7f78b0a2_1563269672826_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">[Overdrive Beam </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#c0392b;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">(Active3)</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"180\" src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/C8E-uRGePdl4etAhOa66hh8jKfIhXVttPwFKZs3ygLjQhepH7XINDj8wnoUkZZL5SA4TiLwhyBPCRgthnbhQy_KLo9OC2pQFi9aSSgXdeVU3LfaJU4lYM-QdlqbglnCpvQ7ZElk\" style=\"float:left\" width=\"330\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">[Stark Sync Special </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#c0392b;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">(Active4)</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"180\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/yufKzfLNpkZV65lLD6sq3Fl5SwB_1yMbRLgCmLSlsCbgqovReGN6mmI2R91Vvfru_DSxiVweN-nTt22-paUJOY9WsPeJSO0ek_aRhf6T2wfrdMVQ0nF1JTt_oCkxQ2BstazNTi4\" style=\"float:left\" width=\"320\"></p>\n\n<p><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">[Nano Gauntlet </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#c0392b;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">(Active5)</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"180\" src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/BScvg3OQFOkYMMxFUJQnv8IdJ-pZ3841jjAeuuJhHmCSD10B97_Fh3dPQG7LpJPambaVgR4t8bJBs3NTO-ogZ9uUSE166Ib7DtcZXj-JfDg2Fmlh77Lv-7ak_cGhsObUh1-hADk\" style=\"float:left\" width=\"320\"></p>\n\n<p><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1563273445376\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/6cdff02c495d44488bdef6ddd7da70a2_1563273445376_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Skill Effect&nbsp;of Captain America's 4th skill (Captain's Hammer) has been changed.</span></span></span></strong></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">- Guards against 4 hits. (4 Sec.) → Invinsible (5 Sec.) </span></span></span></strong></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Skill Effect&nbsp;of Captain America's 5th skill (Mjolnir's Justice) has been changed.</span></span></span></strong></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">- Ignore Defense 5% (10 Sec.)</span></span></span></strong></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Updated on: 7/16 10:15 AM (UTC+0) | 3:15 AM (PDT)</span></span></span></strong></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">[Worthy Uppercut</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#c0392b;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"> (Active1)</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"180\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/YR4X_86UaScTv2n5idQt5Ef4VF7JTUk8S07ySVoAJZUoxDVPLumUWBqrDOLPZ5tiLCvb8WgcKURmU4llSGcpIDdwvSkNo48R4qeSY4ypGYdaWg7iFs998u8-zc1l_JkFRyOS2tk\" style=\"float:left\" width=\"320\"></p>\n\n<p><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">[Captain’s Hammer </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#c0392b;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">(Active4)</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-f2b4eb1f-7fff-fd6c-b843-13136b9c9022\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"180\" src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/tVsaploWj0NJrqFmq_S9ddbBjxEHIPMPTrFnKftpVFwnZIezl_kP0PByNu0Gx1EJ0bN9xDcAq7fXCfh5wPNWsMuZp1Kvnja52QTSlfpvOd-1tZaMYyFViTi7cj4G-HMsLT6bbRc\" width=\"320\"></b></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">[Mjolnir’s Justice </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#c0392b;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">(Active5)</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-1b918e51-7fff-2b74-4c8d-41f54c0f26ce\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"180\" src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/bacziHvVfX0I8zIcjuZdfkpd9jbVYcwAlZZetZrbDBHskvUwH7ZEpzbMRmD0wS1C3S-7GrJejevpSGcpte9-o4I9FZsxYIZB6E272RTLDTj53ZFHBHUPLDFloegw5GUE2hW4KLE\" width=\"320\"></b></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1563269702384\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/fb774d8cf7994022928a6474fc3d1a11_1563269702384_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">[Warlord Assault </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#c0392b;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">(Active4)</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-8cab693f-7fff-91d0-1096-3740298064dd\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"180\" src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/kBF0RNb297vdEIDILVLsjYdqWXCxFJNzU3rd4T-QzmuuerX_Qq2R2dEZX8nmgUxXEQw18GiV28JmwUGEXlfzObHbB60P0_M2mAqeooPVaK8PZ4xhSCpl7sbLqT_qUHMu5RsYHFo\" width=\"320\"></b></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1563254760957\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/9d84dbc694ce4cdf904d67a46a3ef127_1563254760957_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">[Elemental Summon </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#c0392b;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">(Active4)</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-5b42065f-7fff-248b-2855-d279032c8a4a\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"180\" src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/24JWUjt2kk_plOxFHVsgk-6Typy5kk_g-RIEdu-Ru4eVV7UaAjT_h_3UQA7tKkTtPPa450hG7P7LbHNalDthnpPyaQfRyLNyeT9K746bFDqkF8eGtmlHsBrwaolzjP7wdCGG2Wo\" width=\"320\"></b></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* The Skill descriptions shown are based on Level 1.<br>\n* Captain America [Avengers; Endgame] / [Team Suit] and Iron Man [Avengers: Endgame] / &nbsp;[Team Suit] are Synergy uniforms.</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* During the Uniform Discount Event, the Uniform Synergy discount will be applied.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ Others</strong></span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;<br>\n1. The model of Captain America [Avengers: Endgame] has been changed.<br>\n&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">We prepared this update with the feedback we received regarding improving the skills of our Endgame characters. Thank you for your valuable feedback and comments, and we hope you enjoy the improvements we have made.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Thank you.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1563241640655\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/a91f4758a7b64ac39498066e8b455efa_1563241640655_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></span></p>\n"
